ary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/hbm.23052&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792451386692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zN8egJlQ_KUP48ar_ZNyT\">https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/hbm.23052</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nCode: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/record/33432#.Wq403q2cbK\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://zenodo.org/record/33432%23.Wq403q2cbK&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792451386692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw028H2cJde2u4_bBJ5YEboW\">https://zenodo.org/record/33432#.Wq403q2cbK</a>  - although that code does not use a true multivariate distribution.<br>\r\n<br>Many thanks,<div>James</div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
